      "originalText": "A logical load balancing strategy inside the API gateway that \nwill support multiple routing strategy (custom build)\n\nthis will have a way to configure where to send the coming traffic\nbased on the selected strategy or custom rules described in\nyaml file like this :\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
