    },
    {
      "id": "owJglF28hCeqvOIJnKlyW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1501.5905368364945,
      "y": 1883.2259285140824,
      "width": 811.4957885742188,
      "height": 595,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aY",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1891327263,
      "version": 961,
      "versionNonce": 2031009650,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786291014651,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Region Health Monitor - Receive Health info from region\nand updates routing decisions automatically.\n\n3. Routing Policy Engine - Routing strategy should be \nimplemented here like :\n* Nearest Region Routing\n* Weighted Routing - used when  you want to split\n    traffic deliberately\n* Active-Active Routing - traffic distributed across all \n    region\n* Active-Passive Failover - Only one region serves traffic\n    rest stays as standby if the active instance goes down\n    traffic is routed to them instead\n* Latency-Based Routing - Traffic goes to the region with\n    lowest  response time\n* Tenant-Based Routing - \n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Region Health Monitor - Receive Health info from region\nand updates routing decisions automatically.\n\n3. Routing Policy Engine - Routing strategy should be \nimplemented here like :\n* Nearest Region Routing\n* Weighted Routing - used when  you want to split\n    traffic deliberately\n* Active-Active Routing - traffic distributed across all \n    region\n* Active-Passive Failover - Only one region serves traffic\n    rest stays as standby if the active instance goes down\n    traffic is routed to them instead\n* Latency-Based Routing - Traffic goes to the region with\n    lowest  response time\n* Tenant-Based Routing - \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
