      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786291007852,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Dynamic Traffic Shifting\nIF the failure rate increases for a region the engine\nreacts by changing the weight of the region\nto move more traffic to healthy instances\n\nThis is a a toy version of service meshes",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
